Short:    Cli-ListVersion-Cmd v1.36   (German-Doc)
Uploader: frankd@s-direktnet.de
Author:   Frank Derlin (frankd@s-direktnet.de)
Type:     util/cli
Requires: 68020+ v37+
Version:  1.36 (14.10.98) - 3rd Public

The Programm is FREEWARE and © 1998 by Frank Derlin.
It may freely redistributed as long no changes are made.
No Warranty is given and provided "AS IS". So use it at your own Risk.

It's my Combination of "LIST" and "VERSION", but the Output differs a little
from it's great Originals. Note: The Author Stuff is not supported.

For fully Requirements and Usage you have to read the german Guide.

Templ: DIR/A,ALL/S,FULL/S,NAME/S,NOSTATS/S,DEPACK/S,PACKDIR/K,KCON/S,NOBOX/S,NOVER/S,DEBUG/S

DIR     - Must be a Directory,Device or File
All     - Include all Subdirectories
FULL    - Output includes Root
NAME    - Output without Path, only FileNames
NOSTATS - No Statistics
DEPACK  - DeArchiving ("LHEX"40.10+ and "UNLZX" or "LZX"(r) is needed.)
          for Archives like LHA,LZH,LZX,RUN
PACKDIR - Device/Dir instead of default T: for dearchiving (only if really exists)
KCON    - Use KCON: instead of default CON: for Error-Output
NOBOX   - No ProgressBar
NOVER   - No Version-Check, if scan other Stuff
DEBUG   - FileTrace-Window

This Update includes support for LZX(r) and RUN-SFX

WARNING: The Program needs a BIG Amount of WorkSpace in Ram if you scan a
======== whole Device with many packed Archive-Files like CD-ROM's. Click on
         "Systemanforderungen" in the Guide and look for "MaxRAM".
         So I have been warned...
